@HostAddress = http://localhost:5165

### 200 - PREPAID / CLOSED -> ACTION3, ACTION4, ACTION9
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/users/User1/cards/Card17/allowed-actions

### 200 - DEBIT / BLOCKED z PIN-em -> ACTION3, ACTION4, ACTION6, ACTION7, ACTION8, ACTION9
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/users/User1/cards/Card112/allowed-actions

### 200 - CREDIT / ACTIVE bez PIN-u -> zawiera ACTION5 (tylko karty kredytowe)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/users/User1/cards/Card117/allowed-actions

### 400 - lista wartości zamiast identyfikatora
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/users/1,2,4/cards/Card17/allowed-actions

### 400 - wartość ujemna w numerze karty
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/users/User1/cards/-1/allowed-actions

### 404 - brak identyfikatora użytkownika (adres nie pasuje do trasy)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/users//cards/Card17/allowed-actions

### 404 - nieznana karta
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/users/User1/cards/Card999/allowed-actions

### 404 - karta innego użytkownika (Card21 należy do User2)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/users/User1/cards/Card21/allowed-actions
